    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To extract plain text from a scanned document image, I need to use an external provider that offers Optical Character Recognition (OCR) services. One such provider is Amazon Textract, which is a powerful OCR service. I will write the Python code to use Amazon Textract for this task. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789863216175,
          "start": 1789863214086
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc293c06001GA48aS81P9bvpN",
